      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        680,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "v1",
              "name": "pesan",
              "value": "=Halo {{ $json['Nama'] || $json['nama'] || 'Kak' }}! 👋\n\nTerima kasih sudah order di *[NAMA TOKO ANDA]* 🙏\n\nSemoga produknya puya ya!\n\nKalau ada waktu 1 menit, bantu kami kasih review di Google:\n👉 https://g.page/r/GANTI_PLACE_ID/review\n\nReview lo sangat membantu toko kecil seperti kami berkembang. Terima kasih banyak! ⭐",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format",
      "name": "Siapkan Pesan Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        900,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.fonnte.com/send",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "GANTI_TOKEN_FONNTE"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "target",
              "value": "={{ $json['Chat ID'] || $json['chat_id'] || 'GANTI_NOMOR_WA_ADMIN' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.pesan }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "send",
      "name": "Kirim Minta Review (WhatsApp)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        220
      ],
      "notes": "Token Fonnte dari dashboard fonnte.com -> Device -> Token. Ganti GANTI_TOKEN_FONNTE.",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UMKM 06 — Minta Review Otomatis\n\n**Kenapa ini paling worth buat client:**\nIni automation dengan ROI paling jelas. Review Google = pelanggan baru percaya = penjualan naik.\n\n**Alur:**\n1. Status order di Sheets diubah jadi *SELESAI*\n2. Tunggu 24 jam (biar customer sempat pakai produk)\n3. Kirim pesan minta review + link Google\n\n**Yang diedit:**\n- `[NAMA TOKO ANDA]`\n- `GANTI_PLACE_ID` → link review Google Business lo\n- `GANTI_SPREADSHEET_ID`\n\n**Cara dapat link review:**\n1. Google Business Profile → Minta review\n2. Copy link yang muncul\n\n**Catatan:**\nKalau customer belum ada di WhatsApp, ganti node kirim ke WhatsApp/Email.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        100
      ]
    }
